# 🚀 Supply Chain Analysis | End-to-End Data Analytics Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end **Supply Chain Analysis** solution using **Microsoft Excel, PostgreSQL, SQL, Power Query, and Power BI**. The objective is to transform raw supply chain data into meaningful business insights through ETL, data modeling, SQL analysis, and interactive dashboards.

The project follows a complete Business Intelligence workflow, enabling organizations to monitor sales performance, customer behavior, product performance, logistics efficiency, and operational KPIs for data-driven decision-making.

---

## 📊 Project Highlights

- Processed **180,000+ supply chain records**
- Performed **ETL** using Power Query
- Cleaned and transformed raw data
- Built a **Star Schema** data model
- Created **45+ SQL analytical queries**
- Developed an **Excel Executive Report**
- Built **5 interactive Power BI dashboards**
- Generated business insights and strategic recommendations

---

